{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_fvEUVzhmJLEXgPptqml6u9GH","content":"orchestrator-logs/1793385006-zcode-glm-5.3-flash-yang-clojure-track.md:5:Prior logs (historical claims, never appended): orchestrator-logs/1793192500000-glm-resume-yang-clojure-hardening.md,\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:11216:IN FLIGHT at handoff (do not kill; check, they may have finished): (a) opus AD-2 in /Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ad2 (branch admission-ad2, UNCOMMITTED): deletes `principal-admission` and the legacy `:admit` hook, DHT import tests compose `:admission`, renames the foreign-principal test to an-untrusted-principal-is-refused-on-every-vm-test, adds allow and second-publisher head-change cases; brief collab/1792250000000-engineer-ad2.prompt.md, log collab/1792250000000-engineer-ad2.claude-opus-5-5.stdout.log, report to datomworld-ad2/collab/1792250000000-engineer-ad2.findings.md; waits on codex review then ff master. The DHT import artifact must stay unchanged. (b) fable round 2 of the admission-in-linker design: collab/1792262000000-architect-admission-in-linker-r2.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md (brief collab/1792262000000-architect-admission-in-linker-r2.prompt.md); round 1 (collab/1792260000000-architect-admission-in-linker.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md) was REJECTED by codex (collab/1792261000000-reviewer-admission-in-linker.findings.md: false driver-inversion fact, exposure claim, tick-to-VM handoff for a late allow, AL-1 boundary) and then superseded by the language-blind correction (the :yin.link/importer key is deleted).\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:11230:Delegates: Prior-seat fable-5-1 design and codex gpt-6.1-sol review, artifacts `collab/1792262000000-architect-admission-in-linker-r2.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md` and `collab/1792263000000-reviewer-admission-in-linker-r2.gpt-6.1-sol.findings.md`; codex Session-ID not captured in stdout. AD-2 opus-5-5 is still in flight per its report, `collab/1792250000000-engineer-ad2.findings.md`; session ID not recorded there.\ndocs/orc